warning.example:
     $this pseudo-variable का केही उदाहरणहरू


<?php
class A
{
    function foo()
    {
        if (isset($this)) {
            echo '$this is defined (';
            echo get_class($this);
            echo ")\n";
        } else {
            echo "\$this is not defined.\n";
        }
    }
}

class B
{
    function bar()
    {
        A::foo();
    }
}

$a = new A();
$a->foo();

A::foo();

$b = new B();
$b->bar();

B::bar();
?>


     &example.outputs.7;


$this is defined (A)

Deprecated: Non-static method A::foo() should not be called statically in %s  on line 27
$this is not defined.

Deprecated: Non-static method A::foo() should not be called statically in %s  on line 20
$this is not defined.

Deprecated: Non-static method B::bar() should not be called statically in %s  on line 32

Deprecated: Non-static method A::foo() should not be called statically in %s  on line 20
$this is not defined.


     &example.outputs.8;


$this is defined (A)

